//Put here the art IDs (not skill IDs) for combat arts that shouldn't be able to double
// NOTE: as the terminator value is 0, you mustn't put ArtID that has the same value
// As of the writing of this file, IDs 0 (Attack), 1 (Rescue), 2 (Pairup) are recommended to be kept out of this list! for common sense reasons
ALIGN 4
CombatArtsThatCannotDouble:
//BYTE IgnisArtID LunaArtID SolArtID 
BYTE 0 //the terminator


 

